OL,3,GNEWSASir Norman Wisdom memorabilia set 
OL,4,Afor auction                            
OL,6,FSir Norman's son Nick Wisdom said Deal,
OL,7,Fwhere he lived between about nine and  
OL,8,F14, was "very close to his heart".     
